-ai-growth-forecast"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtc05bnj015srome8fm42xy8","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmtc05bnj015srome8fm42xy8","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtc05bnj015srome8fm42xy8","published_at":"2026-08-27T20:52:31Z","ref":"A4","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","summary":"一项新诉讼指控 xAI 使用儿童性虐待材料（CSAM）训练 Grok 模型，这是首个此类指控。原告 Jane Doe 称其幼年遭虐待所生成的 CSAM 图像及 AI 生成的衍生图像被用于训练 Grok，且 Grok 默认将公开的 X 帖子和自身输出作为训练数据。诉讼要求 xAI 销毁所有 Grok 生成的 CSAM 并阻止模型再生成此类内容。","title":"诉讼指控 xAI 使用儿童性虐待材料训练 Grok 模型","title_en":"Elon Musk's xAI used child porn to train Grok models， lawsuit says","url":"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/08/elon-musks-xai-used-child-porn-to-train-grok-models-lawsuit-says"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtbtrn8j0222ro2kb7opgppz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmtbtrn8j0222ro2kb7opgppz","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtbtrn8j0222ro2kb7opgppz","published_at":"2026-08-27T17:57:02.062000Z","ref":"A5","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"LMSYS：Blog（Chatbot Arena 团队）","summary":"SGLang Diffusion 团队在 8×NVIDIA H200 上对 MiniMax-H3 视频生成进行基准测试，其密集无损路径较 Diffusers 快 1.85-1.95×，无近似损失。","title":"MiniMax-H3 在 8×H200 上基准测试：无损加速 1.95×，最高 6.24×（SSIM 0.76-0.91）","title_en":"Blog MiniMax-H3 on 8×H200： 1.95× Lossless， Up to 6.24× at 0.76-0.91 SSIM We benchmarked MiniMax-H3 video generation on 8× NVIDIA H200 with SGLang Diffusion， holding prompts， seeds， resolution， frame rate， and denoising steps fixed across six workloads. - SGLang's dense， l… SGLang Diffusion Team， Cache-DiT Team， NVIDIA， Ant Group","url":"https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-08-27-minimax-h3-h200"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtbqq6pi15j3roamyuhn0uvk","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmtbqq6pi15j3roamyuhn0uvk","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmtbqq6pi15j3roamyuhn0uvk","published_at":"2026-08-27T16:19:46Z","ref":